8,Dahalo Language Documentation Collection | Endangered Languages Archive,https://www.elararchive.org/dk0836,"This project creates a comprehensive audiovisual documentation of the Sanye language, its sociolinguistic situation, and the cultural practices of the Sanye community in coastal Kenya. The project addresses a critical documentation gap for this severely under-documented and critically endangered Cushitic language, facing imminent threats, with intergenerational transmission having almost ...",Dahalo,Afro-Asiatic
